{
  "description": "R4 shell: tray, accessory policy, skipped hotkeys, and a verified blurred pop-up panel opened by the capture hotkey path and by open_view",
  "requirement": "R4 (GPUI Phase 0); R8 with --instances 2",
  "notes": [
    "Automation instances run with UBILINK_SKIP_HOTKEYS=1 (O4), so this asserts hotkeys_skipped and an empty hotkeys_registered; the three real registrations are the maintainer's manual R4 check.",
    "The tray is created whether or not hotkeys are skipped, so tray_present is asserted for real.",
    "window_kind/background stay 'unknown' and window_verified false until a live panel is read back; step 1 pins that, so the later 'popup'/'blurred' cannot be a default."
  ],
  "steps": [
    {"name": "before any panel", "call": "state", "expect": {
      "shell.tray_present": true,
      "shell.activation_policy": "accessory",
      "shell.hotkeys_skipped": true,
      "shell.hotkeys_registered": {"len": 0},
      "shell.window_kind": "unknown",
      "shell.background": "unknown",
      "window_verified": false,
      "route": null
    }},
    {"name": "sink empty", "call": "opened", "expect": {"": {"eq": []}}},
    {"call": "trigger_hotkey", "args": {"action": "capture"}, "expect": {"route": "capture"}},
    {"name": "panel verified", "call": "state", "retry_ms": 3000, "expect": {
      "window_verified": true,
      "shell.window_kind": "popup",
      "shell.background": "blurred",
      "shell.activation_policy": "accessory",
      "shell.tray_present": true,
      "shell.hotkeys_skipped": true,
      "shell.route": "capture",
      "shell.visible": true
    }},
    {"call": "window_id", "expect": {"window_id": {"type": "number", "gt": 0}}},
    {"winframe": "any"},
    {"see": {"role": "Label", "text": "Capture"}},
    {"call": "open_view", "args": {"route": "browser"}, "expect": {"route": "browser"}},
    {"name": "still verified after a route switch", "call": "state", "retry_ms": 3000, "expect": {
      "window_verified": true,
      "shell.window_kind": "popup",
      "shell.background": "blurred",
      "shell.route": "browser",
      "shell.activation_policy": "accessory"
    }},
    {"see": {"role": "Label", "text": "Browse links"}},
    {"call": "open_view", "args": {"route": "capture"}, "expect": {"route": "capture"}},
    {"name": "nothing launched", "call": "opened", "expect": {"": {"eq": []}}}
  ]
}
